# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# The Pixel 8a's Wi-Fi as a network (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.wifinet, boot-args pcie=5 pcie_delay=60 wifi=9), with the display's
# switching exercised meanwhile: unlock, the home screen's pages swiped both ways; then (en0 comes at step 9, ~100 s
# after the start; the job com.hakios.wifi asks configd's IPConfiguration for DHCP on it) an address awaited, the
# interfaces, configd's global IPv4, a name resolved, a page over plain TCP and over HTTPS. src/net_test.m.
/redwood/bin/net_test watch 120
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 1 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 8
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 2
/redwood/bin/net_test waitaddr en0 150 wait 20 show store .*:.*
/redwood/bin/net_test resolve example.com tcp example.com 80 reach example.com
/redwood/bin/net_test fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html
